/************************************************************************
** CLIENT
**   Iron Mountain
**
** MODULE
**   Test_BillingsToBoBCoverage (Class)
**
** PURPOSE
**   Tests the BillingsToBoBCoverage Apex batch job sequence.
**
** NOTES
**   Due to the many objects involved in generating the proper set of 
**   BoB_Coverage_Join__c junction records along with their complex web 
**   of relationships, this unit test class does not create its own test
**   data, but rather relies on access to actual data "(SeeAllData=true)"".
**
**   Due to the difficulty in validating this module's join record creation,
**   it is impractical for this software to serve as a good negative testbed.
**   Therefore this unit test seeks only to exercise the batch job code, 
**   relying on the client's BoB data analysis expertise to spot any problems
**   in the report results produced using the BoB_Coverage_Join__c junction
**   records generated by this batch job.
**
** BUNDLE SUMMARY
**   See class BillingsToBoBCoverage_Master.
**
** CHANGE LOG
**   [[Version; Date; Author; Project/Case; Description]]
**   v1.0; 2013/03/14; Bill Cloward/Bluewolf; Iron Mountain SFDC Billings Data Project (Project a0b00000000FTkA); Initial release
**
************************************************************************/

